# INVWINOA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a location's
# contents, an item list with the item list's keys.  ENTER on Shelf A1,
# which holds Box B2, shows the items of both, Everything below its own
# alone, the frame titled with its path and what is shown, and F1 their
# help (CONTENTS), which ESC closes; ENTER there shows an item in view
# mode, which OK closes; INS shows a new item at A1, its path under
# Location, which OK adds there, the list fetched again holding it; Move
# moves it to B2, out of the list; Parts shows an item's parts, whose ESC
# goes back to the contents; ESC goes back to the tree, Shelf A1
# selected, where Box B2's contents hold the item moved, and a new
# location's contents are empty; ESC goes back to the tree and again to
# the item list; the end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINOA.SNP is its
# snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B DOWN ENTER
S CONTENTS
K ALT-C G
S HERE
K F1
S CHELP
K ESC ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER INS
S NEW
# category SYS, maker Compaq, at A1 as preset
T SYS
K ALT-M
T Compaq
K ENTER
S ADDED
K END ALT-C M
T B2
K ENTER
S MOVED
K HOME ALT-C P
S PARTS
K ESC
S BACK
K ESC
S LOCS
K DOWN ENTER
S B2
K ESC INS
T C3
K TAB
T BOX
K ENTER END ENTER
S EMPTY
K ESC
S LOCS2
K ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F X
